### Test Report Endpoints

# Note: These endpoints require authentication and proper authorization (ReportsView permission)
# The responses will be 401 Unauthorized without proper authentication

### Get Stock Availability Report (All Products)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/stock-availability
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Stock Availability Report (Low Stock Only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/stock-availability?lowStockOnly=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Stock Availability Report (Needs Reorder Only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/stock-availability?needsReorderOnly=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Stock Availability for Specific Product
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/stock-availability/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Report
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Report with Date Filter
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/1?fromDate=2025-07-01&toDate=2025-07-11
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Report by Transaction Type (Receive)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/1?transactionType=Receive
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Report by Transaction Type (Issue)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/1?transactionType=Issue
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Report by Transaction Type (Transfer)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/1?transactionType=Transfer
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Report by Location
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/1?locationId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Summary
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/summary/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product Transaction Summary with Date Range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/product-transactions/summary/1?fromDate=2025-07-01&toDate=2025-07-11
Accept: application/json

###
